Package: saebenchmark
Title: Standardised Benchmark for Small Area Estimation (SAE) Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("SAE Benchmark Lab", email = "sae@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: One-function benchmark for SAE models against BPS two-stage
    finite-population ground truth. Computes ARB, RRMSE, RelEff, Corr,
    runtime and RAM, merges results into results/master_leaderboard.csv,
    and refreshes the minimal web leaderboard in docs/.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    utils
Suggests:
    dplyr
RVersion: 4.1.0
